  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2699\uFE0F THE MECHANICS\nSurvive as long as possible while the world
    speeds up! Instantly shape-shift your vehicle to match the lane you are in. Wrong
    vehicle = Crash!\n\n\u2328\uFE0F CONTROLS\n\u2022 W, A, S, D or Arrows - Move
    and dodge\n\u2022 1 - \U0001F3CE\uFE0F Car (Center Road)\n\u2022 2 - \U0001F6A4
    Boat (Left Water)\n\u2022 3 - \u2708\uFE0F Plane (Air & Canyons)\n\n\U0001F480
    OBSTACLES (AVOID!)\nCrash into these and your run is over:\n\u2022 \U0001F6A7
    Barriers (On the Road)\n\u2022 \U0001FAA8 Rocks (In the Water & Dirt)\n\u2022
    \U0001F388 Blimps (In the Air)\n\n\u2B50 PICKUPS (GRAB!)\nGrab the glowing Star
    for 7 seconds of pure invincibility! You will glow and smash harmlessly right
    through obstacles."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
